@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+---
+id: task-002-fix-order-discounts-coupon-dates-and-shipping-vat
+type: task
+title: "Fix order discounts, coupon dates, and shipping VAT"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Correct three order-service behaviors reported by finance and customers:
+
+- Percentage coupons must apply to the subtotal after volume discounts. Twelve €5.00 notebooks with a 10% coupon should cost €48.60 before VAT.
+- Coupon validity includes its advertised final calendar day. AUTUMN through 30 November must work on 30 November.
+- Shipping is a service and must not have VAT added to it.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- A 10% coupon on twelve €5.00 notebooks discounts the post-volume subtotal (€54.00) by €5.40, leaving €48.60.
+- A coupon is redeemable on `validUntil` and is expired only on a later date.
+- Shipping VAT is zero and order totals exclude VAT on shipping; receipts no longer charge shipping VAT.
